===Etymology===
From {{der|ru|la|cardinālis}} (per Vasmer via {{m+|de|Kardinal}} or {{m+|fr|cardinal}}), further from {{der|ru|la|cardō}}。 {{doublet|ru|шарни́р}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|кардина́л}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Lvova-кардинал.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|кардина́л|a=an|adj=кардина́льский}}

# [[cardinal]] ''(official in Catholic Church)''
#: {{uxi|ru|[[се́рый кардина́л]]|[[power broker]]}}
# {{lb|ru|bird}} [[cardinal]] ''(Cardinalis)''
# [[White Cloud Mountain minnow]] ''(Tanichthys)''
# {{lb|ru|math}} [[cardinality]]
#: {{syn|ru|кардина́льное число́|мо́щность|мо́щность мно́жества}}

